flowchart TD
    Client[Browser research desk]
    API[HTTP API]
    Lifecycle[Conversation lifecycle coordinator]
    Agent[Conversation Agent]
    MCP[Internal Streamable HTTP MCP server]
    Research[Research application and RunHarness]
    Worker[Research Worker and Workflow]
    Store[(SQLite domain stores and durable queues)]

    Client -->|commands and SSE cursor| API
    API -->|authorized conversation command| Lifecycle
    Lifecycle -->|persist messages events and jobs| Store
    Store -.->|leased Agent Turn job| Agent
    Agent -->|research tools over Streamable HTTP| MCP
    MCP -->|authorized submit status or result| Research
    Research -->|persist Run and enqueue job| Store
    Store -.->|leased Run job| Worker
    Worker -->|execute through RunHarness| Research
    Research -->|atomic terminal Run outcome and completion job| Store
    Store -.->|leased completion job| Lifecycle
